        - `final_impression`: a short narrative produced by the LLM that explicitly links the observed RMSD/RMSF patterns and secondary‑structure shifts to mechanistic insights from the literature on kinase/pseudokinase flexibility.  
        - `pdb_data`: optionally embed the raw PDB text for an interactive viewer (if a PDB file is available).  
        - `enriched_prompt`: a concise restatement of the user goal to aid contextual embedding.
   
   5. **Result Delivery**  
      - The report generator will produce `psedukinase_analysis_report.html` in the working directory.  
      - The report will embed all generated plots (`rmsd_plot.png`, `rmsf_plot.png`, `com_3d.png`, `dssp_time_series.png`) and data tables, and will list the literature citations in a reference section.
   
